  "name": "Cancel Pending Transfer",
  "version": "HL7 v2.5.1",
  "chapter": "Patient Administration",
  "description": "The A26 event is sent when an A15 (pending transfer) event is cancelled, either because of erroneous entry of the A15 event or because of a decision not to transfer the patient after all. \n\nThe fields included when this message is sent should be the fields pertinent to communicate this event.  When other important fields change, it is recommended that the A08 (update patient information) event be used in addition.",
